A search of the Internerd earlier suggested this might be a parallel
digital IO card not an A->D card.

Any program applicable to one is unlikely to be applicable to the
other.

Is there something in particular you're trying to achieve?

DEC had some A->D and D->A cards which, shall we say, were closely
related to some Data Translation products (AAV, ADV, AXV spring to
mind). There were diags for some of these, though finding an engineer
who knew what to do with a voltmeter and a trimpot wasn't always easy.


